## Still open

- Whether any definition between Hofstadter's and the Gödelian one is more
  than a restatement of "reflective system".
- Whether the seventh, epistemically bounded definition can be made a theorem
  for anything but formal theories. At present it is a conjecture supported by
  analogy.
- Whether a human is essential. The discussion's answer is no for the
  mathematics and undecided for intelligence.

